@0    = ~Oh, uh—you triggered the hidden easter egg, so I'll jump in for any monsters you'd meet here. Just pretend I'm a, a—uh...~
@1    = ~Pardon, what?~
@2    = ~Biff the Understudy! Long time no see.~
@3    = ~Are you kidding me?~
@4    = ~Wellll... no?~
@5    = ~Yes, it's just like the good old days, right?~
@6    = ~I kind of remained after being in the provisional cast—you know, so the quest can go on without having to implement every detail. Don't worry, I've done this several times. How about we pretend that I'm a... a tanar'ri! That's it. I'm a taaanar'riii...~
@7    = ~Tanar'ri are bad, there is a nabassu fledgling right in this dungeon.~
@8    = ~Oh, that's right. How about... a glabrezuuuu...~
@9    = ~Sorry, Biff, but there is also one of those down by the Seacave.~
@10   = ~Right, right. Hmm, how about... how about a dragon?~
@11   = ~A drag—A DRAGON?~
@12   = ~This is not working, Biff.~
@13   = ~Wait, you're right. I was told that's not an option.~
@14   = ~How about I just give you the lenses you still need? How many do you want?~
@15   = ~...All of them?~
@16   = ~Biff, this is taking too long. Just hand over whatever you've got.~
@17   = ~I regret finding this easter egg. Any chance you could restore the monsters that were supposed to be here?~
@18   = ~Wait! Before you go... What exactly triggered your appearance?~
@19   = ~Good answer!~
@20   = ~I'm awfully sorry, but this isn't possible—way above my pay grade! I'll just give you the lenses and we'll try to forget about this.~
@21   = ~Are you saying you really don't know for sure? All right, it's putting in the black lens, taking it out again, and having only the black but no clear lens in your backpack when going through one of the three picture portals. The devs thought that was unusual enough not to be triggered accidentally. They didn't want anyone experiencing a fourth-wall break without knowing it's an easter egg.~
@22   = ~Well, it was nice meeting you. What now?~
@23   = ~Here you are. It's possible you have too many now, by the way. You'd think they'd take the time to script this more reliably! ...I'll go now. Probably biding my time trying to be a role model somewhere.~
@24   = ~Now, I'll go back to being no one of importance anymore... Oh, you meant for *you*. Well, I guess I'll just give you all the lenses I have.~

